@James:
It is meant to be like RotBR. If you bin them in combat, you get the chance. If you bin them via other means (e.g. Horseshoes) then you'd also get the chance. I understand some fringey decks (i.e. FoS w/ POT) would be able to capitalise on this and there is definately a chance that some of the more combat-ey Nos Princes and Bru Princes decks could gain another boost, but their overall prevalence seems kind of low anyway.

Retired Baron of Sydney, Australia, 418
